#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:5 d687960857e244ae8a74a4dd1bfe8d73
msgid "Simulation"
msgstr "仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:9 b3d26e615c344e93a3c41771374a20df
msgid ""
"Simulation allows for the safe testing of experimental code and settings. "
"Crashing virtual vehicles is a lot cheaper than crashing real ones!"
msgstr "仿真允许对实验代码和设置进行安全测试。虚拟飞行器坠毁的代价远比真实飞行器便宜！"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:12 472c240b6c3d40d19534dee6e6617125
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:14 349755c444b3460bae41dc5bf1eb323c
msgid ""
"Simulation is implemented by using a Flight Dynamics Model (FDM) of the "
"vehicle to simulate the physics involved with vehicle movement. It receives "
"inputs from a SITL (Software in the Loop) program running the ArduPilot "
"firmware (which are the firmware's servo/motor outputs) and outputs vehicle "
"status,position, velocities, etc. that result from those inputs back to the "
"firmware simulation. Just as sensors would in the real world case."
msgstr ""
"仿真通过使用飞行器的飞行动力学模型（FDM）来模拟飞行器运动中涉及的物理过程来实现。它接收来自运行 ArduPilot 固件的 "
"SITL（软件在环）程序的输入（即固件的舵机/电机输出），并将由这些输入产生的飞行器状态、位置、速度等信息输出回固件仿真，就像真实世界中的传感器一样。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:16 e261a8e7c73b47d79dcd4a20a8633831
msgid ""
"Pilot control is implemented either by joystick, dedicated simulation "
"controller box(like Interlink), or by MAVLink commands from a Ground Control"
" Station program (GCS), like MAVProxy or Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"飞手控制通过操纵杆、专用仿真控制器（如 Interlink）或来自地面控制站程序（GCS）（如 MAVProxy 或 Mission Planner）的"
" MAVLink 命令来实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:18 d24691e0686844578a663967c4212736
msgid "This is illustrated below:"
msgstr "如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:22 8cd9ab5a8e414aa5acd65df9aa943385
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides a native firmware simulator + FDM program (all launched "
"by sim_vehicle.py), often simply referred to as ``SITL``, which is usually "
"used with its developer GCS, MAVProxy. ArduPilot's firmware simulator and "
"FDM can also be used by Mission Planner for SITL simulations."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 提供原生固件仿真器和 FDM 程序（均由 sim_vehicle.py 启动），通常简称为 "
"``SITL``，通常与其开发者地面控制站 MAVProxy 配合使用。ArduPilot 的固件仿真器和 FDM 也可被 Mission "
"Planner 用于 SITL 仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:24 1711c66a171f404c920901213cfebaaf
msgid ""
"In addition, the ArduPilot firmware simulator element can also be interfaced"
" to other FDM/Graphics programs that are normally used as stand-alone "
"flight/vehicle simulators in order to get more realistic physics models "
"and/or high definition vehicle graphics, such as RealFlight or X-Plane."
msgstr ""
"此外，ArduPilot 固件仿真器组件还可以与其他 "
"FDM/图形程序对接，这些程序通常用作独立飞行/飞行器仿真器，以获得更逼真的物理模型和/或高清晰度飞行器图形，例如 RealFlight 或 "
"X-Plane。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:28 24c33ba2ee8a486b868606f4fa497d9a
msgid ""
"For code developers, we recommend starting with ArduPilot's native "
":ref:`Software In The Loop (SITL) <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` "
"because the setup is easiest, it does not require a flight controller, and "
"all vehicle types are supported. For non-developers, using Mission Planners "
"integrated simulator does not require setting up a code building "
"environment, for those only wishing to explore simulated behavior of "
"vehicles using existing code."
msgstr ""
"对于代码开发者，我们推荐从 ArduPilot 原生的 :ref:`软件在环（SITL）<sitl-simulator-software-in-the-"
"loop>` 开始，因为设置最简单，不需要飞控硬件，且支持所有飞行器类型。对于非开发者，使用 Mission Planner "
"集成仿真器无需设置代码构建环境，适合那些只想探索现有代码下飞行器仿真行为的用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:30 3f2c2e0ea7734569a6abf976659a7d12
msgid "The most commonly used simulators are:"
msgstr "最常用的仿真器有："

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:32 0c611455a7724e52bbe6e604866d2c91
msgid ""
":ref:`SITL (Software In The Loop) <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` is "
"the simulator most commonly used by developers. It is a simple simulator "
"that is built within all SITL builds of ArduPilot. It is used by the "
":ref:`autotester <the-ardupilot-autotest-framework>` and other simulators "
"below are actually built on top of SITL"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SITL（软件在环）<sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` "
"是开发者最常用的仿真器。它是一个简单的仿真器，内置于所有 ArduPilot 的 SITL 构建中。它被 :ref:`自动化测试系统 <the-"
"ardupilot-autotest-framework>` 使用，下面列出的其他仿真器实际上也建立在 SITL 之上。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:33 b2098905065544f1ab1e82e97bfdc06e
msgid ""
":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:mission-planner-simulation>` can be used in "
"Windows to simulate with Mission Planner as GCS."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:mission-planner-simulation>` 可在 Windows 上以 "
"Mission Planner 作为地面控制站进行仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:34 1c3e6e8380fa4b0d92999082099fdf4a
msgid ""
":ref:`Gazebo <sitl-with-gazebo>` is the official DARPA virtual robotics "
"simulator"
msgstr ":ref:`Gazebo <sitl-with-gazebo>` 是 DARPA 官方虚拟机器人仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:35 7208ac4ecc8d457fa64c0fb515261034
msgid ""
":ref:`XPlane-10 <sitl-with-xplane>` a commercial flight simulator with a "
"rich 3D interface"
msgstr ":ref:`XPlane-10 <sitl-with-xplane>` 是一款具有丰富三维界面的商业飞行仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:36 349a198a3a3a42d4bc160bbbe0a1cd8d
msgid ""
":ref:`XPlane-10 Soaring<soaring-sitl-with-xplane>` soaring on XPlane-10"
msgstr ":ref:`XPlane-10 滑翔<soaring-sitl-with-xplane>` 在 XPlane-10 上的滑翔仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:37 5ed5f6e60e2a4ee699bbc7e53ca7dd12
msgid ""
":ref:`RealFlight <sitl-with-realflight>` a commercial flight simulator with "
"a rich 3D interface and ability to design custom vehicles"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RealFlight <sitl-with-realflight>` 是一款具有丰富三维界面并能设计自定义飞行器的商业飞行仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:38 250da9bcd47d4b11a122cdfbd0cc33ec
msgid ""
":ref:`Morse <sitl-with-morse>` a robotics simulation environment commonly "
"used in research"
msgstr ":ref:`Morse <sitl-with-morse>` 是一个常用于研究的机器人仿真环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:39 8f2a1669c8d34827aac8f19ee865de1d
msgid ""
":ref:`Replay <testing-with-replay>` has no graphical interface but allows "
"re-running master from a dataflash log"
msgstr ""
":ref:`回放 <testing-with-replay>` 没有图形界面，但可以从 Dataflash 日志重新运行 master 分支。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:40 f54cead522834a1db4ddeb4597d7d380
msgid ""
":ref:`JSBSim <sitl-with-jsbsim>` is a sophisticated open-source plane and "
"multicopter simulator with no graphical interface. It can be used with a "
"wide variety of airframes."
msgstr ":ref:`JSBSim <sitl-with-jsbsim>` 是一款无图形界面的复杂开源固定翼和多旋翼仿真器，可用于各种机型。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:41 391f98bf5e0d4f3d854045333592021c
msgid ""
":ref:`AirSim <sitl-with-airsim>` is an open-source, cross-platform simulator"
" for drones & cars, built on Unreal Engine for physically and visually "
"realistic simulations"
msgstr ""
":ref:`AirSim <sitl-with-airsim>` 是一款开源跨平台无人机和汽车仿真器，基于虚幻引擎构建，提供物理和视觉上逼真的仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:42 4ecc61ea89184bf784ba8b1a4b4e474d
msgid ":ref:`Silent Wings Soaring<soaring-sitl-with-silentwings>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Silent Wings 滑翔<soaring-sitl-with-silentwings>`"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:43 3ee06de45c614abbb7acf10afedcd831
msgid ""
":ref:`MATLAB and Simulink<sitl-with-MATLAB>` are numerical computing "
"environments used for developing algorithms and plotting data developed by "
"`MathWorks <https://www.mathworks.com/>`__."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MATLAB 与 Simulink<sitl-with-MATLAB>` 是由 `MathWorks "
"<https://www.mathworks.com/>`__ 开发的用于算法开发和数据绘图的数值计算环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:44 45ae7a669dd648ea840bbd82c197a007
msgid ""
":ref:`JSON interface<sitl-with-JSON>` The JSON interface is a generic "
"interface protocol designed to be easy to implement for those developing "
"physics backend. There are Python and MATLAB examples."
msgstr ""
":ref:`JSON 接口<sitl-with-JSON>` 是一种通用接口协议，旨在方便物理后端开发者实现。提供 Python 和 MATLAB "
"示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:45 2280541142e44e639f4f6c2d77985492
msgid ""
":ref:`Webots <sitl-with-webots>` is a cross-platform robotics simulator that"
" is quick to set up and get running. It currently has examples for "
"multicopter and rover vehicles."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Webots <sitl-with-webots>` 是一款跨平台机器人仿真器，设置简单快捷。目前提供多旋翼和 Rover 飞行器的示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:48 bed4d3dc3b8142cebb29968566765194
msgid "Less often used simulators include:"
msgstr "不常用的仿真器包括："

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:50 427be428b9ab403a9d7af82fa12b4e86
msgid ""
":ref:`Last Letter <using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator>` is a "
"simpler simulator (fixed wing only) with lower CPU requirements than most "
"other simulators."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Last Letter <using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator>` "
"是一款较简单的仿真器（仅支持固定翼），CPU 需求低于大多数其他仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:51 62d3d24c5e2047b6a80eacdfbd6a351a
msgid ""
":ref:`CRRCSim <simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-"
"the-crrcsim-simulator>` is a less commonly used simulator for fixed wing and"
" helicopters."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CRRCSim <simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-"
"the-crrcsim-simulator>` 是一款不太常用的固定翼和直升机仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2.rst:52 cb91536182694d5a8766bd6b28a3edfb
msgid ""
":ref:`SCRIMMAGE <sitl-with-scrimmage>` is an open-source vehicle simulator "
"focused on collaborative robotics"
msgstr ":ref:`SCRIMMAGE <sitl-with-scrimmage>` 是一款专注于协作机器人的开源飞行器仿真器。"

